ref=\"/Isaiah.14.22\">Is 14:22</a> (of Babylon); <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ הַבַּעַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:4\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.4\">Zp 1:4</a>, i.e. <em>Baal, to the last remnant</em>, vestige (so We al.; 𝔊 <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁם</span>, cf. Schwally Now GASm); term. techn. = purified <em>remnant</em> of Israel (Gie<sup>Beiträge 37 f.</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.20\">Is 10:20</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּלֵיטָה</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.21\">21</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.11\">11:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.5\">28:5</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">וּשׁ׳ רוּחַ לוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:15\" href=\"/Malachi.2.15\">Mal 2:15</a> is obscure; read <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּשְׁאֵר ר׳ לָנוּ</span> We Now, cf. GASm.","next":"BDB, שְׁאָר יָשׁוּב","prev":"BDB, שָׁאַר"}